    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Has to… (passive with -s)",
     "texto": [
      "Infinitive + **-s** = to be + past participle:\n\n- vaske → **vaskes** (to be washed)\n- feje → **fejes** (to be swept)\n\nBilen **skal vaskes** = The car has to be washed.\nFortovet **bør fejes** = The pavement should be swept.\n\nIn English we'd say «it has to be…» or «it needs…»."
     ],
     "tutora": "pensando"
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "garage or værksted",
     "texto": [
      "**garage** is where you keep the car at home. The workshop where they fix it is a **værksted**."
     ],
     "tutora": "pensando"
    }
   ]
